{"meta":{"id":"wireguard","category":"it/server/infra/home-server","title":"5. WireGuard VPN","subtitle":"","summary":"wg0 10.0.0.0/24, NAT · IP 포워딩, 윈도우 · 휴대폰 클라이언트(분할 터널), UDP 5xxxx 포트 포워딩만 열기, 연결 확인","tags":["ubuntu","리눅스","서버","홈서버","wireguard","vpn","보안"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"ubunto_start","updatedAt":"2026-11-01"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>VPN</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-11-01</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">5. WireGuard VPN</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> wg0 10.0.0.0/24, NAT · IP 포워딩, 윈도우 · 휴대폰 클라이언트(분할 터널), UDP 5xxxx 포트 포워딩만 열기, 연결 확인</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">구성</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">항목</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">값</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">VPN 인터페이스 · 포트</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>wg0</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>5xxxx/UDP</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">VPN 대역</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>10.0.0.0/24</code> — 집 랜 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>192.168.0.x</code> 와 겹치지 않게</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">서버 / 윈도우 / 휴대폰</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>10.0.0.1</code> / <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>10.0.0.2</code> / <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>10.0.0.3</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">서버와 클라이언트가 각자 개인키 / 공개키 쌍을 만들고 상대 공개키를 자기 설정에 등록합니다. 비밀번호 없이 키로만 인증하고, 개인키는 밖으로 꺼내지 않습니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">서버 설치 · 키</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">sudo apt install -y wireguard\r\nsudo -i\r\ncd /etc/wireguard\r\numask 077                                    # 키 파일을 root 만 읽게\r\nwg genkey | tee server_private.key | wg pubkey &gt; server_public.key\r\nexit</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">서버 설정 (/etc/wireguard/wg0.conf)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">ini</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">[Interface]\r\nAddress = 10.0.0.1/24\r\nListenPort = 5xxxx\r\nPrivateKey = &lt;server_private.key&gt;\r\n\r\n# VPN → 집 랜 · 인터넷으로 나갈 수 있게 NAT (enp0s25 = 서버 유선 랜)\r\nPostUp   = iptables -A FORWARD -i wg0 -j ACCEPT; iptables -A FORWARD -o wg0 -j ACCEPT; iptables -t nat -A POSTROUTING -o enp0s25 -j MASQUERADE\r\nPostDown = iptables -D FORWARD -i wg0 -j ACCEPT; iptables -D FORWARD -o wg0 -j ACCEPT; iptables -t nat -D POSTROUTING -o enp0s25 -j MASQUERADE\r\n\r\n[Peer]\r\n# 윈도우 PC\r\nPublicKey = &lt;윈도우 공개키&gt;\r\nAllowedIPs = 10.0.0.2/32\r\n\r\n[Peer]\r\n# 휴대폰\r\nPublicKey = &lt;휴대폰 공개키&gt;\r\nAllowedIPs = 10.0.0.3/32</pre></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">sudo chmod 600 /etc/wireguard/wg0.conf\r\necho &#x27;net.ipv4.ip_forward=1&#x27; | sudo tee /etc/sysctl.d/99-wireguard.conf\r\nsudo sysctl --system\r\nsudo ufw allow 5xxxx/udp                     # ufw 가 active 일 때만\r\nsudo systemctl enable --now wg-quick@wg0     # 설정 바꾼 뒤엔 restart</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">IP 포워딩과 NAT 는 VPN 으로 들어온 트래픽을 서버가 집 랜 · 인터넷으로 넘겨주기 위한 것입니다 (서버 자신에만 접속할 거면 생략 가능).</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">클라이언트</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">윈도우는 WireGuard 설치 → <strong class='text-stone-900'>빈 터널 추가</strong> 하면 키가 자동 생성되고, 위쪽 공개키를 서버 [Peer] 에 넣습니다. 휴대폰은 WireGuard 앱에서 처음부터 만들기 → 키 생성, 주소 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>10.0.0.3/32</code>, DNS 는 비움. SSH 는 ConnectBot 에서 만든 키를 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>devuser</code> 에 등록했습니다.</p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">ini</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">[Interface]\r\nPrivateKey = &lt;자동 생성된 값 그대로&gt;\r\nAddress = 10.0.0.2/32\r\n\r\n[Peer]\r\nPublicKey = &lt;server_public.key&gt;\r\nEndpoint = &lt;공인 IP&gt;:5xxxx        # 집 안 테스트는 192.168.0.10:5xxxx\r\nAllowedIPs = 10.0.0.0/24, 192.168.0.0/24\r\nPersistentKeepalive = 25</pre></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">항목</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Endpoint</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">서버 주소. 집 안 테스트는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>192.168.0.10</code>, 밖에서는 공유기 공인 IP (또는 DDNS)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>AllowedIPs</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>VPN 대역 + 집 랜만</strong> VPN 으로 (분할 터널). 모든 인터넷을 보내려면 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>0.0.0.0/0</code> + <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>DNS = 1.1.1.1</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>PersistentKeepalive</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">25초마다 신호를 보내 공유기 NAT 에서 연결이 끊기지 않게</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">외부망 접속 — 공유기 포트 포워딩</h2><span class=\"ml-auto text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">✅ 적용</span></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">항목</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">값</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">소스 IP · 포트</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>비움</strong> — 접속해 오는 쪽(밖의 노트북 · 휴대폰) 조건이라, 여기에 집 공인 IP 나 5xxxx 을 넣으면 밖에서 연결이 안 됨</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">외부 포트 → 내부</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>5xxxx</code> → <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>192.168.0.10:5xxxx</code>, 프로토콜 <strong class='text-stone-900'>UDP</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">• 포워딩은 <strong class='text-stone-900'>WireGuard 포트 하나만</strong>. SSH(22)는 밖으로 열지 않는다<br>• 포트 번호를 바꿔도 보안 이득은 거의 없다 — WireGuard 는 등록된 키가 아닌 패킷엔 응답하지 않아 포트 스캔으로도 열려 있는지 알 수 없다<br>• 공인 IP 는 KT 에서 DHCP 로 받아 드물게 바뀐다 → 밖에서 갑자기 안 되면 서버에서 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>curl -4 ifconfig.me</code> 로 확인 후 Endpoint 수정. 자주 바뀌면 DDNS 갱신 프로그램 설치</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">연결 확인</h2><span class=\"ml-auto text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">🔄 외부망 남음</span></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">sudo wg show            # 서버 — peer 마다 latest handshake 가 2분 이내면 연결 OK\r\nping 10.0.0.1           # 윈도우 — 터널로 서버까지\r\nssh devuser@10.0.0.1         # 성공\r\nssh adminuser@10.0.0.1     # Permission denied 가 정상 (VPN 에서 관리자 차단)</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">2026-11-01 집 안에서 확인: <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ping 10.0.0.1</code> 손실 0% · 1 ms, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ssh devuser@10.0.0.1</code> 접속(출발지 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>10.0.0.2</code>), <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>adminuser@10.0.0.1</code> 은 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>not listed in AllowUsers</code> 로 거부. <strong class='text-stone-900'>남은 것</strong>: 휴대폰 핫스팟 같은 외부망에서 같은 확인.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">트러블슈팅</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">증상</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">확인할 것</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">서버 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>wg show</code> 에 handshake 없음</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">키 교차 확인 — 서버 [Peer] 엔 클라이언트 공개키, 클라이언트 [Peer] 엔 서버 공개키. Endpoint, 포트 포워딩(UDP), <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ss -ulnp | grep 5xxxx</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">handshake 는 되는데 ping 안 됨</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">클라이언트 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Address</code> 와 서버 [Peer] <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>AllowedIPs</code> 일치 여부</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">서버는 되는데 집 랜이 안 됨</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">IP 포워딩, PostUp NAT 인터페이스 이름(<code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>enp0s25</code>)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>wg-quick@wg0</code> 시작 실패</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>journalctl -u wg-quick@wg0 -e</code> (오타, 키 형식)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">집 안에서 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>adminuser</code> 접속이 거부됨</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">VPN 을 켠 채라 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>192.168.0.0/24</code> 도 VPN(10.0.0.2)을 거쳐 들어감 → 집 안에서는 VPN 을 끄고 접속</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">자주 쓰는 명령</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">sudo wg show                          # 상태 · 핸드셰이크\r\nsudo systemctl restart wg-quick@wg0   # 설정 반영\r\nsudo wg-quick down wg0 / up wg0       # 수동 중지 / 시작</pre></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/infra/home-server/wireguard","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"infra","title":"인프라","path":"it/server/infra"},{"id":"home-server","title":"홈 서버 (Ubuntu)","path":"it/server/infra/home-server"}],"hasImage":false}